{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7247a6f3cf2ee54b86735d31baf1e979eeb1852f172d14c57fef1e7205f30210", "ja": "応答─レスポンス─", "zh": "响应─Response─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d2853ca9c6c2ecb31fba61c452d8aeb4be1589a9f02018cd14d18aacf452a45c", "ja": "ココロを学ぶため、人間の『お悩み相談』に\n答えていくアンドロイド達。調子よく相談事\nを解決していくが、恋愛に関する質問が来て\nうろたえるツムギ。", "zh": "为了学习人类的内心，回答人类“烦恼咨询”的安卓们。她们顺利地解决着各种烦恼，却在收到有关恋爱的提问后，紬慌了神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "b00aa5e6b10efb5d5db0dc0965bd8323e01c357a1c2569341092e6f1bb1f18ea", "ja": "それでは早速、人間たちから集めた悩みを\nバッサバッサと解決していきましょう。", "zh": "那么事不宜迟，就把从人类那里收集来的烦恼一个接一个地解决掉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e59a10bdc9df2497bcd9156731201d40dc9efcdadd9aa4c9a5494a12d270733f", "ja": "はい。アンドロイドとして、\n立派に人類の役に立ってみせます。", "zh": "好的。作为仿生人，我一定会好好为人类效劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "86609f5740c11133faf77541ae314ac59c5a5ddb992d0ff383edfcccad7141e3", "ja": "それじゃあ、私から。「こんにちは。\n私は女子陸上部のキャプテンをしています」", "zh": "那么，接下来由我开始。“你好。我是女子田径部的队长。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "3e6c399d12ee36a6b7fa66c8b6e9f2642ea762cb3ed438c0805a6723cd125f42", "ja": "「最近、練習がつらいと部員から苦情がありました。\n黙々と走り込む競技なので、気持ちはわかります」", "zh": "「最近有部员抱怨练习太辛苦。\n因为这项运动就是得默默苦练跑步，所以我能理解她们的心情」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "76dd8ae9f71ac465684664f690f9d9c5bbddcc91b75dfde45bef68fe49348207", "ja": "「ただ、ついてこれない人はそこまでと思っている\n自分もいます。私はどうするべきでしょうか？」", "zh": "「只是，我心里也觉得跟不上的人\n也就只有这种程度了。我该怎么做才好呢？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "867c7035629ec6774e0f637d02b7e5a0c0cfb5758d92df1b730487bfd06a4bcd", "ja": "なるほど……。真面目に\n部活に取り組んでいる方なんですね。", "zh": "原来如此……看来是位认真参加社团活动的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "8a0ad4e27665236e627c454989b43c4c17905bf7453f867542f068844a67754f", "ja": "練習メニューの改善をすべきなのでしょうか……。\nシホ、どう回答しますか？", "zh": "应该改善训练菜单吗……\n志保，你会怎么回答呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "646aac5cb773ac24d127e6241d4a619dc564663e7cbfdeb623dbcd0bd2636104", "ja": "そうね……。ついてこれない人はそこまで、\nそれは、その通りだと思う。", "zh": "是啊……跟不上的人也就到此为止了，\n我觉得确实如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "627ce4fc6126261db3ea3239bb09bc5968421f4b95b41f47dc6068b7bbea6b53", "ja": "おお、クール系な答えです。", "zh": "哦，还真是冷酷型的回答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "3f078dc1fb645afc2cb1924d646bb14f526f7bcb9cdf4c6e0185df3c8abe6859", "ja": "でも……ええと。そうやって切り捨ててしまう前に、\n一度、その人と話し合ってみた方がいいのかも。", "zh": "不过……那个。在彻底放弃对方之前，或许还是应该先和那个人谈一谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef42ea2698d12138b5facca53c7d7c402297107d6666c2350660132e8a9f6393", "ja": "その結果、ぶつかり合って嫌な思いをするかも\nしれないけど……。", "zh": "结果或许会让彼此发生冲突，心里也会不好受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "74ffbb959c7bd6d8eb78deceddca546324efeb4b268aabc209931eeaeab633e6", "ja": "もしかしたら……ひとりで走っていたら\nわからなかったことが、わかるかもしれないから。", "zh": "说不定……能明白那些如果只是自己一个人奔跑，\n就无法弄明白的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1012_audience", "source_sha256": "0a07adea3eb908222854edd0e778ebf08d6cb58143ebef441e83f3dc149c855c", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "36ececcd0e6e078f6d5b64c682fcfd0dfec610e8a4189575e3614cdc2b6cdc24", "ja": "あの……今みたいので、よかったんでしょうか？\n上手な回答になっていたか不安だけど……。", "zh": "那个……刚才那样的回答，可以吗？\n虽然有点担心自己有没有答好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "5168f17c04020be3dc257da95d5f1ff2dc4af212448c6b04092a2184da4caec7", "ja": "素晴らしい回答だったかと。\nこの拍手の音がその証拠です。", "zh": "应该是非常精彩的回答。\n掌声就是证据。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5bb9ce020c784669d9c2a9730efb92084cc5c2faf55f5e2bbc185fbfe1311c81", "ja": "はい。シホのココロを感じられました。\n次のお悩みへとまいりましょう。", "zh": "是的。我感受到了志保的心意。\n接下来请进入下一个烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "1667ca031a785389c66fb0fae043746e6e61ff9ba1ffd99fbbbd608cbb767833", "ja": "では、私が。「こんにちは。\n私は笑顔がとても下手っぴです」", "zh": "那么，由我来吧。“你好。\n我很不擅长露出笑容。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "95f8622415e56ff1acc74421b20a94cbaa74eae709e6e2de146d134b73044b62", "ja": "「友達と遊んでもおしゃべりしても、楽しいはずなのに\nうまく笑顔を返せません。たまにつらいです」", "zh": "「和朋友一起玩也好，聊天也好，明明应该很开心，\n却没办法很好地回应笑容。有时会觉得难过。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "44c26051f007d8932ab31ae374cc31087a34ca57da1e49b9277c0a6bbed297b5", "ja": "「アンドロイドも、笑顔になったりしますか？\nよければ笑顔の作り方を教えてほしいです。」", "zh": "「仿生人也会露出笑容吗？\n可以的话，希望能教教我该怎么露出笑容。」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "73c4c042cf778b4fd1a7bac9160c4acbf609856a2628efcbd6dd0428b38dc7d7", "ja": "笑顔の作り方……。\n私もあまり、自信はないけれど……。", "zh": "关于笑容的做法……\n我也不太有自信，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "be1b704747b14482f7cc1d01f5fb7c6b423d042c69943b72a72006f819b563fc", "ja": "私は一応、呉服屋の店番……いえ、アンドロイド用の\nスーツ販売を行ったデータも保存されていますが……。", "zh": "我姑且还保存着在和服店看店的资料……不对，还保存着销售安卓专用套装的数据……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "4f160291ecd4355e8adc2eb7fd4e72465aec26d983f41bb357abc3e76c9831f7", "ja": "いえ、このお悩みには私が責任をもって回答します。\nこの方の気持ち、私はとてもよくわかります。", "zh": "不，这个烦恼就由我来负责解答。\n这位的心情，我非常能够理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "72ffc8ac31484cb156fc5ea636684a9311e1609234d5e51923cde15bcdb6fd15", "ja": "笑顔を返せないのは、つらいです。せっかくもらった\nものに、なにもお返しができないみたいで……。", "zh": "无法回以笑容，是很痛苦的。明明难得收到了礼物，却好像什么都无法回报……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "36b0119cf53e358b3db314ecdb7cfb117b9d2cd271974d5b2af858d6807722cf", "ja": "お返しができない……。", "zh": "没办法回报……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "375b966eb44df14235c5ec896de34b7e4a26608740312464bc9d2577d6136e6c", "ja": "それがつらさの原因だとしたら、色々な\nお返しの方法を考えてみるのがいいと思います。", "zh": "如果无法回报，那就是痛苦的原因的话，我觉得不妨试着想想各种回报的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc64e2fcf9e9f2a7949edef3ad431ea2bae39a3f133ec6c22894bffca0263bb2", "ja": "言葉でもスキンシップでも、頑張って表現してみて\nください。……個人的には、手品をオススメします。", "zh": "不管是用言语还是肢体接触，都请努力表达出来。……就我个人而言，我推荐手法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1026_audience", "source_sha256": "147d8146c289a570906b4bb90b3ba1c8a39ee9080b57fc9c52b2da167621f1de", "ja": "ワアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "454b0f62490f8a52e277c338e9af5a74873e2f618d0c5f85214fbfb4722e796e", "ja": "シホもミズキも、いい調子ですね。\n私も負けないように回答します。", "zh": "志保和瑞希状态都不错呢。\n我也会回答得不输给你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "42a8b4585810696f049da9e8b88d194c694f37448fd90c7fcd0fb6c886660234", "ja": "「こんにちは。私は今JKなのですが\n好きな人ができてしまい、とても困っています」", "zh": "“你好。我现在是一名女子高中生，\n有了喜欢的人，感到非常困扰”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a113a527af705ccac683f46bf84c64ef7f7f08adc07389714abeb5d06d756285", "ja": "「その人は真面目だったりちょけたり掴みどころが\nなく、私はいつも振り回されているうちに……」", "zh": "“那个人时而认真，时而胡闹，让人捉摸不透，我总是在被他牵着鼻子走的过程中……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7a3a9a7a533efa82c1ea6b6f4a2ada76796355a4d1a8cbbbe9bb6fdbcd216c57", "ja": "「頭がその人でいっぱいになってしまいました。\n正確なAIで私の恋の行方を導いてほしいです！」", "zh": "「满脑子就全都是那个人了。\n希望精准的AI能为我指引恋情的走向！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "683039bd5d17869d1281cf915db5b9626be1199fd5dddff8d382acb91592c32d", "ja": "おお、これはいわゆる恋愛相談ですね。", "zh": "哦，这是所谓的恋爱咨询吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8219fa9e17c800d0b8e68859cb1e02b3c36fea200e674a296c3cd430e5962897", "ja": "こ、恋の行方！？　……。あ、あの、\nこれにはみんなで答えませんか……？", "zh": "恋、恋情的走向！？……啊、那个，\n这件事要不要大家一起来回答……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "84b1c4d98a48e93842cbceca2c2ead2a5603b6a194aad0cd4b347bcbfd0b8abb", "ja": "さっき「シホとミズキに負けないように」って\n言ってたと思うけど……いいの？", "zh": "刚才你不是说过“不能输给志保和瑞希”吗……这样没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
